{"id":"aa0209ba799780d1","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-krein-milman.md","title":"Krein–Milman Theorem","display":"thm-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-krein-milman","aliases":["58-thm-krein-milman"],"display":"thm-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-krein-milman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-krein-milman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3482d3dfe87a8b71\" href=\"?note=3482d3dfe87a8b71\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" href=\"?note=341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C,E,H,K,X,x,\\tau,\\sigma,\\mathcal P,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\">\\(A,C,E,H,K,X,x,\\tau,\\sigma,\\mathcal P,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S:V^7\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S:V^7\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are from the topology dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are the exact structured predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" href=\"?note=341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" title=\"58-df-convex-set\">58-df-convex-set</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\\Bigl(\nx=+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\cdot_X(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\n\\cdot_X(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\\Bigl(\nx=+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\cdot_X(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\n\\cdot_X(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,A,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(X,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nD\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq D\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(D,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,A,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(X,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nD\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq D\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(D,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}topological\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X:\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap A\\neq\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}topological\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X:\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap A\\neq\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,K,\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\sigma)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists E,H,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{x\\in K:\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,E,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,H,X,\\tau)\n\\land K=C\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,K,\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\sigma)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists E,H,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{x\\in K:\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,E,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,H,X,\\tau)\n\\land K=C\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology, vector operations, seminorm family, Hausdorff guard, subspace topology, and compactness predicate are all explicit.  Convexity and extremality use the same designated operations; the former carrier-only <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,X)\\)</span> could existentially choose unrelated operations.</li>\n<li>Convex hull and topological closure are bounded set predicates defined in this atom, so neither <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}\">\\(\\operatorname{conv}\\)</span> nor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau\\)</span> remains an undeclared operator.</li>\n<li>The theorem states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> is the closed convex hull of its extreme points.</li>\n<li>Metrizability alone does not remove the closure in infinite dimensions; in finite-dimensional spaces, Minkowski's theorem gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\operatorname{conv}(\\operatorname{Ext}(K))\">\\(K=\\operatorname{conv}(\\operatorname{Ext}(K))\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Choquet theorem: points in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> are barycenters of probability measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ext}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{ext}(K)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications include representation and fixed-point arguments in functional analysis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3482d3dfe87a8b71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"341b5a5ae2ec5b04","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ are the exact structured predicates from [[58-df-compact]] and [[58-df-convex-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-convex-set","status":"resolved","id":"341b5a5ae2ec5b04","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ are the exact structured predicates from [[58-df-compact]] and [[58-df-convex-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,C,E,H,K,X,x,\\tau,\\sigma,\\mathcal P,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S:V^7\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\\Bigl(\nx=+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\cdot_X(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\n\\cdot_X(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}structured\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,A,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(X,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land H=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nD\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq D\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(D,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}topological\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land C=\\{x\\in X:\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap A\\neq\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,K,\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\sigma)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists E,H,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{x\\in K:\\mathrm{StructuredExtremePoint}_S(x,K,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{StructuredConvexHull}_S(H,E,X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopologicalClosure}_S(C,H,X,\\tau)\n\\land K=C\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\operatorname{conv}(\\operatorname{Ext}(K))","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ext}(K)","display":false}],"bytes":4031,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-krein-milman.md|58-thm-krein-milman]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["7d71608bc30daeda","69f8a4b0afb36176","74086485fba8d86f","3482d3dfe87a8b71","341b5a5ae2ec5b04","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}